CE-0032 was withdrawn on 2026-09-12. The id is not reused.

The review loop accepted it on 2026-09-12 against Overtime.WeeklyOvertime, but it
was not a defect. Its inputs were a one-row timesheet, which WeeklyOvertime
counts as hour 1 of the Payroll Week, not the 50th hour its fact pattern
described. On those inputs the rule's overtime_payment of 115 is correct
((2.0 - 1.0) + 0.15, times 100), and the expected 150 followed from none of the
reviewer's reasoning. Its headline, that the night premium was ignored, was also
wrong: the 115 includes it.

The attempt is in reviewer/rounds/overtime.jsonl.
